{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>粉嶺有兒童懷疑猝死。今日（17日）清晨6時許，警方接獲吉祥街8號欣翠花園一名男子報案，指其11歲兒子在住所睡房床上昏迷不醒。</p><p>救護員接報到場，證實男童已明顯死亡；據了解，男童生前有身體病患紀錄，警方將案件列作「屍體發現」處理，將安排驗屍確定死因。</p><figure><img alt=\"粉嶺吉祥街8號欣翠花園一名11歲男童昏迷，當場證實不治。（Google街景截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188021971502239744632741.jpeg/Dj6IFMuzbvattvuUcUzpMCODDtDzQX2LiK5-x4iufsc\"/><figcaption>粉嶺吉祥街8號欣翠花園一名11歲男童昏迷，當場證實不治。（Google街景截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T00:59:12.392678+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T23:03:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T07:18:02.934411+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T00:57:40.433472+00:00","content_hash":"5b0fbc47ae68e2686c36654a37b8a1106034d86c359b980e322aec2eff5db174","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}